  "methodology": "Four denoiser models/functions, one preparation and release per fresh native process, without inference. Pair order alternates serial/batch then batch/serial. Same pinned build for both arms. Full source hashes are streamed before every arm; SDK/OS caches are retained, without a cache purge.",
